kkan paket sebagai owner/repo@versi (tambahkan #varian sebelum @ untuk varian lain)\, repositori lain seperti gitee.com/owner/repo@versi\, atau URL https\:// dari arsip ZIP.";pkg_install_id_body,481,V401606adc,de01606bb6,;"Masukkan paket sebagai owner/repo@versi (tambahkan #varian sebelum @ untuk varian lain)\, repositori lain seperti gitee.com/owner/repo@versi\, atau URL https\:// dari arsip ZIP.";pkg_install_id_body,482,V401605b15,b801605bc9,;"パッケージを owner/repo@バージョン の形式 (別のバリアントの場合は @ の前に #バリアント を追加)、gitee.com/owner/repo@バージョン のような他のリポジトリ、または ZIP アーカイブの https\:// URL で入力してください。";pkg_install_id_body,483,V40169711f,e501697200,;"Insira um pacote como owner/repo@versão (adicione #variante antes do @ para outra variante)\, outro repositório como gitee.com/owner/repo@versão\, ou a URL https\:// de um arquivo ZIP.";pkg_install_id_body,484,V4017b71a7,e6017b7289,;"Введите пакет в виде owner/repo@version (для другого варианта добавьте #variant перед @)\, другой репозиторий\, например gitee.com/owner/repo@version\, или ссылку https\:// на ZIP-архив.";pkg_install_id_body,485,V401696c4d,f301696d3c,;"Paketi owner/repo@sürüm biçiminde (başka bir varyant için @ öncesine #varyant ekleyin)\, gitee.com/owner/repo@sürüm gibi başka bir depo olarak veya bir ZIP arşivinin https\:// URL'si olarak girin.";pkg_install_id_body,486,V40160698c,d601606a5e,;"Nhập gói dưới dạng owner/repo@version (thêm #variant trước @ để chọn biến thể khác)\, một kho khác như gitee.com/owner/repo@version\, hoặc URL https\:// của tệp nén ZIP.";pkg_install_id_body,487,V4015f50ad,8e015f5137,;"请输入 owner/repo@版本 形式的包（其他变体请在 @ 前加上 #变体），其他仓库如 gitee.com/owner/repo@版本，或 ZIP 压缩包的 https\:// 链接。";deleting_world,7,V401635bd8,3a01635c0e,;"Deleting world…";deleting_world,8,V4016361d8,3c01636210,;"Eliminando mundo…";deleting_world,9,V4016362d8,4001636314,;"Suppression du monde…";deleting_world,10,V401635ef0,4201635f2e,;"वर्ल्ड हटाया जा रहा है…";deleting_world,11,V401635e06,3b01635e3d,;"Menghapus dunia…";deleting_world,12,V401