онтент";content_detected_title,16,V4002d0957,43002d0996,;"İçerik Algılandı";content_detected_title,17,V4002d092e,48002d0972,;"Đã phát hiện nội dung";content_detected_title,18,V4002d0832,3a002d0868,;"检测到内容导入";creator_notice_source_text,561,V40007031e,dd000703f7,;"LeviLauncher uses an account that owns Minecraft to download directly from Google Play. The source below shows how LeviLauncher downloads through the Google Play API.";creator_notice_source_text,489,V401175970,fa01175a66,;"LeviLauncher usa una cuenta que posee Minecraft para descargarlo directamente de Google Play. El código fuente de abajo muestra cómo LeviLauncher descarga el juego mediante la API de Google Play.";creator_notice_source_text,490,V401175a34,10701175b37,;"LeviLauncher utilise un compte possédant Minecraft pour le télécharger directement depuis Google Play. Le code source ci-dessous montre comment LeviLauncher utilise l’API Google Play pour ces téléchargements.";creator_notice_source_text,491,V401175600,eb011756e7,;"LeviLauncher\, Minecraft खरीद चुके खाते का उपयोग करके सीधे Google Play से डाउनलोड करता है। नीचे दिया गया सोर्स कोड दिखाता है कि LeviLauncher Google Play API से कैसे डाउनलोड करता है।";creator_notice_source_text,492,V4011555c3,ed011556ac,;"LeviLauncher menggunakan akun yang memiliki Minecraft untuk mengunduh langsung dari Google Play. Kode sumber di bawah menunjukkan cara LeviLauncher mengunduh melalui Google Play API.";creator_notice_source_text,493,V4011555c3,ed011556ac,;"LeviLauncher menggunakan akun yang memiliki Minecraft untuk mengunduh langsung dari Google Play. Kode sumber di bawah menunjukkan cara LeviLauncher mengunduh melalui Google Play API.";creator_notice_source_text,494,V401154901,a5011549a2,;"LeviLauncherはMinecraftを所有するアカウントを使用して、Google Playから直接ダウンロードします。以下のソースコードで、Google Play APIを利用したダウンロード方法を確認できます。";creator_notice_source_text,495,V40117582f,ed01175918,;"O LeviLauncher usa uma conta que possui o Minecraft para baixar diretamente do Google Play. O código-fonte abaixo mostra como o LeviLauncher faz os downloads pela API do Google Play.";creator_notice_source_text,496,V4011b56d5,ef011b57c0,;"LeviLauncher скачивает Minecraft напрямую из Google Play с аккаунта\, на котором куплена игра. В исходном коде ниже показано\, как LeviLauncher использует Google Play API для скачивания.";creator_notice_source_text,497,V40117553a,f301175629,;"LeviLauncher\, doğrudan Google Play’den indirmek için Minecraft’a sahip bir hesap kullanır. Aşağıdaki kaynak kod\, LeviLauncher’ın Google Play API üzerinden nasıl indirme yaptığını gösterir.";creator_notice_source_text,498,V40115541e,ca011554e4,;"LeviLauncher dùng tài khoản sở hữu Minecraft để tải trực tiếp từ Google Play. Mã nguồn bên dưới cho biết cách LeviLauncher tải qua Google Play API.";creator_notice_source_text,504,V4001a066b,9b001a0702,;"LeviLauncher 使用已购买 Minecraft 的账号直接从 Google Play 下载游戏。下方源码展示了 LeviLauncher 如何通过 Google Play API 下载游戏。";mm_circle,503,V4002c0af3,2c002c0b1b,;"Circle";mm_circle,489,V40141664f,2d01416678,;"Círculo";mm_circle,490,V401416752,2c0141677a,;"Cercle";mm_circle,491,V401416202,2901416227,;"गोल";mm_circle,492,V4013f61db,2f013f6206,;"Lingkaran";mm_circle,493,V4013f61db,2f013f6206,;"Lingkaran";mm_circle,494,V4013f52f8,28013f531c,;"円形";mm_circle,495,V4014164b9,2d014164e2,;"Círculo";mm_circle,496,V40145630f,2a01456335,;"Круг";mm_circle,497,V40141617a,2b014161a1,;"Daire";mm_circle,498,V4013f5fd5,2f013f6000,;"Hình tròn";mm_circle,504,V40048103a,280048105e,;"圆形";content_ui_sort_name,523,V4000b0262,35000b0293,;"Name";content_ui_sort_name,489,V4000a024e,37000a0281,;"Nombre";content_ui_sort_name,490,V4000a024c,34000a027c,;"Nom";content_ui_sort_name,491,V4000a0235,34000a0265,;"नाम";content_ui_sort_name,492,V4000a0233,35000a0264,;"Nama";content_ui_sort_name,493,V4000a0233,35000a0264,;"Nama";content_ui_sort_name,494,V4000a020b,33000a023a,;"名前";content_ui_sort_name,495,V4000a0249,35000a027a,;"Nome";content_ui_sort_name,496,V4000a0237,39000a026c,;"Название";content_ui_sort_name,497,V4000a0