enu Mod untuk menambahkan tombol overlay individual.";mod_menu_active_desc,12,V402f1cb54,b702f1cc07,;"Semua mod bawaan sekarang dapat diakses melalui Menu Mod dalam game. Nonaktifkan Menu Mod untuk menambahkan tombol overlay individual.";mod_menu_active_desc,13,V402f1ac91,6a02f1acf7,;"すべての内蔵モッドは、ゲーム内のモッドメニューからアクセスできます。ボタンを個別に追加するには無効にしてください。";mod_menu_active_desc,14,V402f1cc22,9902f1ccb7,;"Todos os mods integrados agora estão no Menu dentro do jogo. Desative para adicionar botões individuais.";mod_menu_active_desc,15,V402f9d05e,af02f9d109,;"Все встроенные моды теперь доступны через игровое мод-меню. Отключите мод-меню\, чтобы добавить отдельные кнопки поверх экрана.";mod_menu_active_desc,16,V402f1cb76,c102f1cc33,;"Tüm yerleşik modlara artık oyun içi Mod Menüsü üzerinden erişilebilir. Bireysel katman düğmeleri eklemek için Mod Menüsü'nü devre dışı bırakın.";mod_menu_active_desc,17,V402f0cb69,c102f0cc26,;"Tất cả các mod tích hợp sẵn giờ đây đều có thể truy cập thông qua Menu Mod trong game. Vô hiệu hóa Menu Mod để thêm các nút điều khiển riêng lẻ.";mod_menu_active_desc,18,V402f19ed8,5902f19f2d,;"所有内置模组现在都可以通过游戏内模组菜单访问。禁用模组菜单以添加单个悬浮窗按钮。";pkg_err_install_failed,476,V4004913e6,4f00491431,MissingTranslation;"The package operation failed";pkg_err_install_failed,477,V400481409,560048145b,;"La operación de paquetes ha fallado";pkg_err_install_failed,478,V40048147d,56004814cf,;"L'opération sur le paquet a échoué";pkg_err_install_failed,479,V400481413,4a00481459,;"पैकेज कार्रवाई विफल रही";pkg_err_install_failed,480,V400481378,46004813ba,;"Operasi paket gagal";pkg_err_install_failed,481,V400481378,46004813ba,;"Operasi paket gagal";pkg_err_install_failed,482,V4004810f3,4100481130,;"パッケージ操作に失敗しました";pkg_err_install_failed,483,V4004813dc,4e00481426,;"A operação de pacote falhou";pkg_err_install_failed,484,V40048137e,50004813ca,;"Операция с пакетом не удалась";pkg_err_install_failed,485,V40048133e,4e00481388,;"Paket işlemi başarısız oldu";pkg_err_install_failed,486,V400481353,480048