s Google Play avec son code\, par exemple 972108003 pour la 1.21.80.3. Google Play ne fournit que les versions encore disponibles pour ce compte.";game_download_by_code_message,491,V4004c16fe,e3004c17dd,;"Google Play से किसी खास बिल्ड को उसके संस्करण कोड से डाउनलोड करें\, जैसे 1.21.80.3 के लिए 972108003। Google Play केवल वे बिल्ड देता है जो अब भी इस खाते के लिए उपलब्ध हैं।";game_download_by_code_message,492,V4004c16f5,e6004c17d7,;"Unduh build tertentu dari Google Play menggunakan kode versinya\, misalnya 972108003 untuk 1.21.80.3. Google Play hanya menyediakan build yang masih tersedia untuk akun ini.";game_download_by_code_message,493,V4004c16f5,e6004c17d7,;"Unduh build tertentu dari Google Play menggunakan kode versinya\, misalnya 972108003 untuk 1.21.80.3. Google Play hanya menyediakan build yang masih tersedia untuk akun ini.";game_download_by_code_message,494,V4004c13db,98004c146f,;"バージョンコードを指定してGoogle Playから特定のビルドをダウンロードします。例：1.21.80.3は972108003です。このアカウントで現在利用できるビルドのみ取得できます。";game_download_by_code_message,495,V4004c1779,eb004c1860,;"Baixe uma compilação específica do Google Play pelo código da versão\, como 972108003 para a 1.21.80.3. O Google Play só fornece as compilações ainda disponíveis para esta conta.";game_download_by_code_message,496,V4004c16e1,df004c17bc,;"Скачайте нужную сборку из Google Play по коду версии\, например 972108003 для 1.21.80.3. Доступны только сборки\, которые Google Play ещё предоставляет этому аккаунту.";game_download_by_code_message,497,V4004c16dc,d9004c17b1,;"Belirli bir yapıyı sürüm koduyla Google Play’den indirin\; örneğin 1.21.80.3 için 972108003. Google Play yalnızca bu hesap için hâlâ mevcut olan yapıları sunar.";game_download_by_code_message,498,V4004c16a6,dc004c177e,;"Tải một bản dựng cụ thể từ Google Play bằng mã phiên bản\, ví dụ 972108003 cho 1.21.80.3. Google Play chỉ cung cấp các bản dựng vẫn còn khả dụng cho tài khoản này.";game_download_by_code_message,499,V4001605ac,8e00160636,;"通过版本代码从 Google Play 下载指定构建，例如 1.21.80.3 的版本代码为 972108003。Google Play 只会提供此账号仍可获取的构建。";bg_image_blur,7,V403a0f17d,2e03a0f1a7,;"Blur";bg_image_blur,8,V403a1007a,3403a100aa,;"Desenfoque";bg_image_blur,9,V403a1031d,2e03a10347,;"Flou";bg_image_blur,10,V403a0f919,3203a0f947,;"धुंधलापन";bg_image_blur,11,V403a0f970,3303a0f99f,;"Keburaman";bg_image_blur,12,V403a0f970,3303a0f99f,;"Keburaman";bg_image_blur,13,V403a0d348,2d03a0d371,;"ぼかし";bg_image_blur,14,V403a0faa3,3203a0fad1,;"Desfoque";bg_image_blur,15,V403a8ff70,3203a8ff9e,;"Размытие";bg_image_blur,16,V403a0f9a7,3703a0f9da,;"Bulanıklaştır";bg_image_blur,17,V4039ff9b7,2c039ff9df,;"Mờ";bg_image_blur,18,V403a0c340,2c03a0c368,;"模糊";pkg_no_description,476,V400af3371,4700af33b4,MissingTranslation;"No description available";pkg_no_description,477,V400ae360b,4c00ae3653,;"No hay descripción disponible";pkg_no_description,478,V400af36b7,4c00af36ff,;"Aucune description disponible";pkg_no_description,479,V400ae3465,4400ae34a5,;"कोई विवरण उपलब्ध नहीं";pkg_no_description,480,V400ad331d,4200ad335b,;"Tidak ada deskripsi";pkg_no_description,481,V400ad331d,4200ad335b,;"Tidak ada deskripsi";pkg_no_description,482,V400ad2be3,3700ad2c16,;"説明はありません";pkg_no_description,483,V400ae3580,4b00ae35c7,;"Nenhuma descrição disponível";pkg_no_description,484,V400b033ec,4300b0342b,;"Описание отсутствует";pkg_no_description,485,V400ae3306,3b00ae333d,;"Açıklama yok";pkg_no_description,486,V400ad32dc,3c00ad3314,;"Chưa có mô tả";pkg_no_description,487,V400ac26e6,3300ac2715,;"暂无简介";external_mods_importing,7,V401b57076,4201b570b4,;"Importing mod…";external_mods_importing,8,V401b57771,4301b577b0,;"Importando mod…";external_mods_importing,9,V401b5791d,4701b57960,;"Importation du mod…";external_mods_importing,10,V401b5743c,4b01b57483,;"मॉड इम्पोर्ट हो रहा है…";external_mods_importing,11,V401b573c1,4201b573ff,;"Mengimpor mod…";external_mods_importing,12,V401b573c1,4201b573ff,;"Mengimpor mod…";external_mods_importing,13,V401b5621a,4001b56256,;"Mod をインポート中…";external_mods_importing,14,V401b57401,4301b5744