est.json e um arquivo .so.";invalid_zip_mod_package_message,15,V400c73287,7500c732f8,;"ZIP-пакет мода должен содержать manifest.json и файл .so.";invalid_zip_mod_package_message,16,V400c7316b,7800c731df,;"ZIP mod paketi manifest.json ve bir .so dosyası içermelidir.";invalid_zip_mod_package_message,17,V400c731e6,7100c73253,;"Gói mod ZIP phải chứa file manifest.json và file .so.";invalid_zip_mod_package_message,18,V400c72614,5f00c7266f,;"ZIP 模组包必须包含 manifest.json 与 .so 文件。";game_download_sign_out_message,488,V4000c0385,ac000c042d,;"Sign out of Google Play? Active downloads will stop. Downloaded APKs and installed instances stay on this device.";game_download_sign_out_message,489,V4004314e7,cf004315b2,;"¿Cerrar sesión en Google Play? Las descargas activas se detendrán. Los APK descargados y las instancias instaladas permanecerán en este dispositivo.";game_download_sign_out_message,490,V4004314e6,d1004315b3,;"Se déconnecter de Google Play ? Les téléchargements en cours s’arrêteront. Les APK téléchargés et les instances installées resteront sur cet appareil.";game_download_sign_out_message,491,V40043140d,ba004314c3,;"Google Play से साइन आउट करें? चल रहे डाउनलोड रुक जाएँगे। डाउनलोड किए गए APK और इंस्टॉल किए गए इंस्टेंस इस डिवाइस पर बने रहेंगे।";game_download_sign_out_message,492,V400431413,b8004314c7,;"Keluar dari Google Play? Unduhan aktif akan berhenti. APK yang diunduh dan instans yang terpasang tetap ada di perangkat ini.";game_download_sign_out_message,493,V400431413,b8004314c7,;"Keluar dari Google Play? Unduhan aktif akan berhenti. APK yang diunduh dan instans yang terpasang tetap ada di perangkat ini.";game_download_sign_out_message,494,V400431151,8b004311d8,;"Google Playからサインアウトしますか？進行中のダウンロードは停止します。ダウンロード済みのAPKとインストール済みのインスタンスはこの端末に残ります。";game_download_sign_out_message,495,V40043147b,ca00431541,;"Sair do Google Play? Os downloads em andamento serão interrompidos. Os APKs baixados e as instâncias instaladas permanecerão neste dispositivo.";game_download_sign_out_message,496,V400431418,b1004314c5,;"Выйти из Google Play? Активные загрузки остановятся. Скачанные APK и установленные экземпляры останутся на устройстве.";game_download_sign_out_message,497,V400431411,b0004314bd,;"Google Play’den çıkış yapılsın mı? Etkin indirmeler durdurulur. İndirilen APK’lar ve yüklü örnekler bu cihazda kalır.";game_download_sign_out_message,498,V4004313d3,ab0043147a,;"Đăng xuất Google Play? Các lượt tải đang chạy sẽ dừng. APK đã tải và các bản cài đặt vẫn được giữ trên thiết bị.";game_download_sign_out_message,499,V4000c031e,71000c038b,;"退出 Google Play 登录？正在进行的下载将停止。已下载的 APK 和已安装的实例会保留在此设备上。";batch_delete_worlds_message,7,V4044b245f,7d044b24d8,;"Delete %1$d selected worlds? Backups will be created before deletion.";batch_delete_worlds_message,8,V4044b37b4,91044b3841,;"¿Eliminar %1$d mundos seleccionados? Se crearán copias de seguridad antes de eliminarlos.";batch_delete_worlds_message,9,V4044b3b29,90044b3bb5,;"Supprimer %1$d mondes sélectionnés ? Des sauvegardes seront créées avant la suppression.";batch_delete_worlds_message,10,V4044b2c7b,75044b2cec,;"%1$d चुनी गई दुनियाएँ हटाएँ? हटाने से पहले बैकअप बनाए जाएँगे।";batch_delete_worlds_message,11,V4044b2eb3,80044b2f2f,;"Hapus %1$d dunia yang dipilih? Cadangan akan dibuat sebelum penghapusan.";batch_delete_worlds_message,12,V4044b2eb3,80044b2f2f,;"Hapus %1$d dunia yang dipilih? Cadangan akan dibuat sebelum penghapusan.";batch_delete_worlds_message,13,V4044bff20,62044bff7e,;"選択した %1$d 個のワールドを削除しますか？削除前にバックアップが作成されます。";batch_delete_worlds_message,14,V4044b3166,82044b31e4,;"Excluir %1$d mundos selecionados? Backups serão criados antes da exclusão.";batch_delete_worlds_message,15,V40453359a,850453361b,;"Удалить выбранные миры (%1$d)? Перед удалением будут созданы резервные копии.";batch_delete_worlds_message,16,V4044b2da9,7c044b2e21,;"Seçili %1$d dünya silinsin mi? Silmeden önce yedekler oluşturulacak.";batch_delete_worlds_message,17,V4044b2d7b,79044b2df0,;"Xóa %1$d thế giới đã chọn? Bản sao lưu sẽ đượ